	('7e39e4af-8551-4350-ae50-d34f4168dd8a', '2024-12-22 00:03:30.757972+00', 'Mint Julep', 'Cool, crisp, and Southern to the core. Bourbon, fresh mint, and sugar over crushed ice in a frosted silver cup. The official drink of the Kentucky Derby—and a front porch classic since the 18th century.', 904, false, '2.5 oz bourbon
