	('800791dd-2953-4eff-8968-7eca9a8ef05b', '2024-12-22 00:01:52.843834+00', 'Old Fashioned', 'Simple, sturdy, and endlessly refined. Bourbon or rye, sugar, bitters, and a twist of orange over ice. One of the oldest known cocktails—proof that good taste never goes out of style.', 901, true, '2 oz bourbon or rye whiskey
