	('fc5b90e9-00ea-459c-b63d-818cbf66a1ad', '2024-12-22 00:09:07.343804+00', 'Appletini', 'Sweet, tart, and playfully crisp. A vibrant mix of vodka and sour apple liqueur, shaken and served straight up.', 910, true, '2 oz vodka
