	('3765f506-219a-4934-b316-060e1a8f2dcf', '2024-12-22 00:04:51.709892+00', 'Boulevardier', 'Sophisticated, rich, and brooding. Bourbon, sweet vermouth, and Campari stirred to a smooth, bittersweet finish. Think Negroni in a velvet smoking jacket—created in 1920s Paris for an American expat with impeccable taste.', 906, true, '1.25 oz bourbon
