	('00066652-516f-4094-bbb5-92399cecf3cc', '2024-12-21 23:45:46.269016+00', 'The Gangster''s Paradise', 'Served at the 1923 Prohibition Bar (Las Vegas). Hints of Raspberry meld with lime and gin.', 21, true, '2 oz Gin (a classic London Dry Gin works well)
