	('c640c3ae-05eb-4bd5-899a-8f604461fe9d', '2025-01-01 01:10:14.595426+00', 'The True Amaretto Sour', 'A true Amaretto Sour contains no bourbon. But many modern bars add it anyway to save a bit of money. Horrifying. If you must have an Amaretto Sour with bourbon, go for #920 — but yes, we’ll judge you.', 919, true, NULL, '2 oz AMARETTO (BRAND: Disaronno)
