	('7e3dfead-3c73-42fa-bf20-c9cf84427e57', '2025-04-30 19:02:36.907698+00', 'All Too Neat', 'This bourbon-based drink is for the bridges you scream in your car. It’s smooth, moody, and built on bourbon and heartbreak. Numbered #321 for the number of words in All Too Well (10 Minute Version) [Taylor''s Version] [From The Vault].', 321, true, NULL, '2 oz BOURBON (BRAND: Woodford Reserve, SUB: anything)
