	('9ad98870-dc45-400f-a8cc-c9da6e957608', '2025-06-24 00:34:04.646369+00', 'The Suffering Bastard', 'This gin and cognac cocktail is bright, spicy, and layered. Originally served at Officina Milano (Milan, Italy). Numbered 590 for the year of Milan''s establishment as a city (590 BCE).', 590, false, NULL, '0.75 oz HENNESSY COGNAC (BRAND: Hennessy VS, SUB: Any VS Cognac)
