	('57276cd4-a681-41b1-93bf-bce0fae7cafd', '2025-06-24 00:53:03.744858+00', 'Bugsy', 'Bugsy Siegel—or Moe Greene, depending on who you ask—was perhaps the greatest Jewish mobster to ever live. He was also one of the country''s famous bootleggers. This drink''s overwhelming taste of whiskey is saved by Campari, in the same way Siegel saved Billy Wilkerson''s Flamingo casino in the 1940s. Numbered #3555 for the Flamingo''s address in Las Vegas, NV.', 3555, true, NULL, '1.5 oz RYE WHISKEY
