	('3e19f0bd-e8e8-411b-9863-9b365b2c3993', '2025-06-09 15:44:30.958663+00', 'The Silent Partner', 'Originally served at Angel''s Share, a famous New York City-based speakeasy. It comes to the 7M menu for the first time. Japanese whisky with hints of Yuzu. Awarded No. 1933 in honor of Angel''s Share''s year of opening. ', 1993, false, NULL, '2 oz JAPANESE WHISKY
