	('86aa359b-ad1d-4bcc-83d8-09bf9114f827', '2025-06-09 02:05:34.138217+00', 'La Passion d’Anna', 'Crisp, citrusy, tropical sophistication — like golden hour in a silk dress. This passionfruit drink is No. 1533, numbered after the year of the fruit''s introduction to Europe. ', 1533, false, NULL, '1 oz GIN, dry
