	('90f35652-40b2-42be-bb47-beda327db77d', '2025-04-30 19:17:02.838643+00', 'Golden Frog Time', 'Absinthe, dry vermouth, and rye whiskey meld together for a drink that doesn''t beg for attention — it earns it. It''s the kind of drink you order when you are planning to sabotage an up-and-coming juice company.

