	('9551adbe-d8c0-4463-a161-092e582b82c1', '2025-10-08 15:03:30.956489+00', 'The Smoldering Apple', 'Elegant, warming, and just sweet enough — a drink that smells like a wood fire and orchard air. Featuring Apple Brandy paired nicely with maple syrup. ', 78, true, NULL, '2.0 oz APPLE BRANDY
