	('0dea09a7-c462-4003-8b26-121940f1cd1a', '2025-04-30 18:54:19.77272+00', 'The Bartlet Demand', 'This drink is equal parts grit and optimism — whiskey-forward, lemon-bright, and tempered by just enough vermouth to suggest diplomacy. It’s what Sam Seaborn would order while rewriting Article II and pretending everything’s fine. Based on the Sorkin hit "The West Wing." Served as #1600 in reference to the White House''s address.', 1600, true, NULL, '2 oz RYE WHISKEY
