	('4fb0e926-d444-42d6-987f-4d5939fb2d99', '2025-06-24 00:37:33.046665+00', 'The Willebrandt', 'Based on the life of Mabel Walker Willebrandt, the Assistant Attorney General from 1921–1929, known for enforcing prohibition. We find no better way to stick it to the Deborah of the Drys than to name an alcoholic drink after her. Given No. 1921 for the year of her nomination to become the third highest-ranking official in the Department of Justice, then the highest office held by a woman in the United States government.', 1921, true, NULL, '1.5 oz RYE WHISKEY
