0.25 oz LEMON JUICE
0.25 oz HONEY (SUB: Maple Syrup)
1 dash ANGOSTURA BITTERS

Stir the rye, gin, vermouth, lemon, honey, and bitters with ice.
Strain into the coupe.

SERVE: Coupe, up
GARNISH: Lemon twist — long and stern', '{Whiskey,Gin}'),
	('c7367db0-659c-494a-8ad6-50cc39ff4a8b', '2024-12-21 23:36:42.213515+00', 'The Verbena', 'Served at the Dunnkirk Library (Bloomington, IN). This drink tastes like tequila lemonade — at the start. It is served with a Schezuan Buzz Button, a flower that transcends all understanding. Ask your bartender how it works.', 16, false, '6 lemon verbena leaves
1 ounce ginger syrup
1.5 ounces blanco tequila
3 ounces yuzu-calamansi sour mix
Garnish: Szechuan button', '1 oz ginger syrup (SUB: simple syrup)
