2 oz blanco tequila

SERVE: ice, Tom Collins glass (SUB: coupe glass)
GARNISH: Szechuan buzz button, lemon wheel, (optional) mint leaves

Ginger Syrup: equal parts water and sugar. Add ginger.

Yuzu-Lemon Syrup: equal parts water, sugar, yuzu juice, lemon juice.', '{Tequila,Copycats}'),
	('4035909e-c716-4c83-b984-4e369379a727', '2024-12-21 23:53:57.106245+00', 'The Golden Hour', 'A truly radiant bourbon cocktail.', 31, false, '2 oz bourbon
