	('a9139d46-d266-4a33-aad2-30b0b88c13c7', '2025-12-30 21:57:40.870855+00', 'Seven Nuts and Berries', 'Decadent, smooth, and dangerously easy to drink—dessert in a glass with a milkshake soul. A play on the Nuts and Berries.', 93, true, NULL, '0.75 oz Vodka
