	('83cf81ff-1de3-44f7-bd02-8f9cddad6682', '2025-12-30 22:01:20.869303+00', 'The Midnight Bell', 'Our New Year’s Eve signature. Elegant, ceremonial, and unmistakably celebratory—this is the moment the room goes quiet and the year turns.', 2025, false, NULL, '1.25 oz Cognac
