	('7e304ebd-9cda-4e53-a0ad-51f8597ed0b7', '2025-06-09 15:36:26.980641+00', 'Shoreditch', 'Dark, inventive, and impossibly smooth — a cocktail with underground flair and jazz-club swagger, built for those who never leave before the second set. Given #129 in honor of the famous Nightjar cocktail bar, located at 129 City Road, Shoreditch, London, UK. ', 129, false, NULL, '1.5 oz VODKA (BRAND: Belvedere, SUB: any elegant neutral vodka)
