SERVE: Coupe, NO ICE.
FLAVOR BLAST: berry bubble', '{Vodka}'),
	('63357067-f097-4373-bb10-ef2c04a02e86', '2025-06-24 00:44:06.454603+00', 'The Underground''s Italian Créme Soda', 'Originally served at The Underground speakeasy (Las Vegas, NV). This vodka-based drink is an ode to old-style soda machines, which started to pop up in the 1920s. Given #300 for the address of the Las Vegas-based speakeasy: 300 E Stewart Ave. ', 300, true, NULL, '1.25 oz VANILLA VODKA
