0.5 oz CHERRY SYRUP
1.0 oz HEAVY CREAM

Shake the vodka, amaretto, cherry syrup, and cream hard over ice.
Strain into a chilled rocks glass with fresh ice or serve up in a coupe.

SERVE: Coupe or rocks glass, up or on ice depending on vibe
GARNISH: Luxardo cherry on a cocktail pick (or better: skewered cherry + almond)', '{Vodka,Copycats}'),
	('bfcb3937-f461-41df-94ec-8f556dcb6bca', '2024-12-22 00:15:11.069518+00', 'Mudslide', 'Dessert in a glass. Vodka, chocolate cream liqueur, and Irish cream shaken smooth and creamy, served over ice. Born in the Cayman Islands and beloved everywhere—rich, indulgent, and impossible to sip just once.', 913, true, '1 oz whipped cream vodka/vanilla vodka
1 oz chocolate cream liqueur
1.5 oz Bailey''s chocolate
1 oz Bailey''s Smores

GARNISH: chocolate shavings
', '1.0 oz BAILEY''S CHOCOLATE
