Also in mini book.', '{Vodka}'),
	('75e9b4ba-9ce3-4aed-b22e-4b07b4b76bbb', '2024-12-22 00:16:26.706373+00', 'Mojito', 'A Cuban classic bursting with freshness. White rum, muddled mint, lime juice, sugar, and soda water over ice. Rumored to have started as a medicinal tonic—now it’s just good for the soul.', 914, true, '2 oz light rum
