Mint leaves

Gently muddle mint with syrup and lime juice. Add rum, ice, and top with soda. Stir lightly.

SERVE: Highball glass, over crushed ice
GARNISH: Mint bouquet and lime wheel', '{Rum}'),
	('bc609754-c62a-4e41-8d3b-c7ae82098192', '2024-12-22 00:10:02.121153+00', 'Espresso Martini', 'Bold, silky, and irresistibly smooth. Vodka, coffee liqueur, and fresh espresso shaken to a perfect crema. Created to "wake you up and mess you up"—a modern classic with a caffeinated kick. Order #33 for a special coconut version. ', 911, false, '2 oz vodka
1 oz Kahlua
0.5 oz chocolate liqueur
0.5 oz simple syrup

GARNISH: coffee beans', '1.5 oz VODKA
