	('c9e9c15f-2abf-4f63-b364-104328b41196', '2025-10-08 15:52:25.637228+00', 'Golden Orchard', 'A bright, orchard-forward gin cocktail with just enough sweetness to feel like fall without heaviness.', 87, false, NULL, '1.5 oz GIN
