	('f9920a5b-cdc6-45bf-9440-163b8c09f242', '2025-05-02 13:34:41.485754+00', 'MacBeth''s Dagger', 'A blood-red gin cocktail soaked in sweetness and shadow—perfect for plotting murder or just overthinking your ambition. Citrus and cherry swirl like guilt in Dunsinane’s halls, and the finish lingers longer than Lady Macbeth’s conscience. Hathaway probably made this drink, but our mixologists will take all the credit. Based on Hathaway''s (or Shakespeare''s) "The Tragedy of Macbeth" and numbered for the year of its premiere (1606).', 1606, true, NULL, '1.5 oz GIN (BRAND: Monkey 47, SUB: Hendrick’s or Bombay Sapphire)
0.75 oz BLOOD ORANGE JUICE (SUB: fresh orange juice with a dash of grenadine)
0.5 oz SWEET VERMOUTH (BRAND: Carpano Antica, SUB: Dolin Rouge)
0.25 oz CHERRY SYRUP/GRENADINE (SUB: Luxardo syrup from the jar)
2 dashes ANGOSTURA BITTERS

Shake with ice until thoroughly chilled. Strain into a chilled coupe.

SERVE: Coupe, no ice
GARNISH: A single Luxardo cherry sinking slowly to the bottom

OPTIONALS...
FLAVOR BLAST: Blood orange aroma misted above the glass
SMOKE: Cherrywood, optional—evokes a scorched battlefield', '{Gin}'),
	('8afd6cd7-48d1-4162-a09b-80aebdb2f4fc', '2024-12-21 23:22:47.721375+00', 'The DWB', 'A classic whiskey sour. No egg white in the DWB version. Want egg white? Go for #921.', 9, true, 'Ingredients:

2 oz Quality Bourbon or Rye Whiskey
3/4 oz Fresh Lemon Juice
1/2 oz Simple Syrup
1 Egg White (optional, for a silky texture)
Orange Peel (for garnish)
Bitters (Either cherry or orange)', '2.0 oz BOURBON (Brand: Woodford Reserve)
