SMOKE: optional', '{Bourbon}'),
	('21152a1f-6625-4242-b772-b567105e2427', '2025-12-30 21:45:15.032309+00', 'Candlemas', 'Quietly elegant. Orchard fruit, oxidative depth, and just enough bitterness to keep it adult.', 1225, false, NULL, '1.75 oz Apple Brandy (SUB: Cognac)
