	('bf95c5e2-1caf-4794-9cc8-33f6ff811669', '2025-12-30 21:51:55.866889+00', 'Tom & Jerry', 'Old-world holiday indulgence—rich, warming, and unmistakably festive. A winter classic done properly. Originally served at The Golden Tiki (Las Vegas, NV).', 3939, false, NULL, '1.00 oz Dark Rum (BRAND: Plantation Original Dark, SUB: Goslings Black Seal)
1.00 oz Cognac
1 tbsp Tom & Jerry Batter**
Hot Whole Milk, to top

Build gently in a pre-warmed mug.

SERVE: Small ceramic mug or traditional Tom & Jerry cup, hot
GARNISH: Freshly grated nutmeg, ground clove, ground allspice

HOUSE TOM & JERRY BATTER

(Keep refrigerated; yields multiple servings)

Separate 3 eggs

Whip egg whites with ¼ tsp cream of tartar to stiff peaks

Beat yolks with 1 cup sugar, 0.50 oz Jamaican dark rum, and ¼ tsp vanilla extract

Gently fold yolk mixture into whites until fully incorporated', '{Copycats,New,Winter}'),
	('2a0edf34-d49d-4a6f-9891-eaeca195d2c6', '2025-10-08 15:43:57.498085+00', 'Veil of Autumn', 'A silky, maple-kissed rum cocktail built for the first truly cold night — lush, smooth, and just sweet enough', 85, true, NULL, '1.5 oz DARK RUM (BRAND: Diplomatico Reserva; SUB: Gosling’s Black Seal)
0.5 oz AMARO
