Add all ingredients to a shaker with ice and shake hard until the cream thickens and the drink feels cold and plush. Double strain into a chilled coupe.

SERVE: Coupe (NO ICE).
GARNISH: Sugar rim (optional)', '{Fall,Rum}'),
	('322f801c-1dd2-45f9-bed2-fe734533cdee', '2025-10-08 15:37:42.834199+00', 'Between the Embers', 'An opulent, campfire-kissed cocktail that captures the quiet warmth of late autumn — smoke, sweetness, and the memory of fire. Originally served at The Dead Rabbit, the famous New York-based speakeasy.', 84, false, NULL, '1.25 oz KNOB CREEK 9 YEAR BOURBON (SUB: Elijah Craig Small Batch)
