Stir all ingredients over ice until velvety and cold. Strain into a double old fashioned glass over one large cube.

SERVE: Rocks glass, LARGE CUBE.
GARNISH: Expressed orange peel and a toasted mini marshmallow resting on a cocktail pick.
FLAVOR BLAST: Smoke bubble filled with campfire aroma (optional, adds theatrics and nostalgia).
SMOKE: Hickory or cherry wood for a warm, sweet smoke note.', '{Fall,Bourbon,Copycats}'),
	('48ca8ccb-cd7e-4da3-9af7-e3e7021f5f1a', '2025-12-30 21:55:10.340851+00', 'Peanut Butter Tropic', 'Playful on the nose, surprisingly composed on the palate—dessert-adjacent, but balanced enough to behave. Created specifically to be served on Royal Caribbean''s Icon of the Seas. Numbered 1400 for the ship''s yard number. ', 1400, true, NULL, '2.00 oz Peanut Butter Whiskey (BRAND: Skrewball, SUB: Sheep Dog Peanut Butter Whiskey)
2.00 oz Pineapple Juice
0.50 oz Fresh Lemon Juice
2 dashes Aromatic Bitters (SUB: Orange bitters)

