	('238dc884-4abb-4dd9-847f-1763261c9df9', '2025-01-01 00:35:34.673939+00', 'Crisp Apple Blossom', 'The Crisp Apple Blossom is autumn elegance in a glass — light, orchard-fresh, and gently kissed with maple sweetness. Fresh apple juice gives it a clean, juicy backbone, while lemon brightens and balances. The maple syrup rounds out the edges with a touch of warmth, especially when paired with vodka’s clarity or the soft spice of apple brandy.', 44, true, NULL, '1.5 oz vodka or apple brandy
2.5 oz fresh apple juice
1/2 oz maple syrup
1/3 oz lemon juice

Shake all ingredients with ice until chilled and slightly frothy. Fine strain into a chilled coupe or Nick & Nora glass.

SERVE: Coupe or Nick & Nora, no ice.
GARNISH: Thin apple fan or single dried apple chip resting on the rim. Optional lemon twist for brightness
FLAVOUR BLAST: Apple blossom or cinnamon aroma bubble', '{Vodka}'),
	('29d053ef-4d7f-4bf8-8181-74528c45ed6d', '2025-12-30 21:42:37.006368+00', 'Frost and Ash', 'A contemplative winter Old Fashioned—quiet smoke, restrained sweetness, long finish.', 90, true, NULL, '2.00 oz Bourbon (PREF: Michter’s US*1, SUB: Woodford Reserve)
