GARNISH: Expressed orange peel, discarded
CHOOSE...(optional)
- FLAVOR BLAST: Cedar aroma
- SMOKE: Light applewood smoke', '{Bourbon,New,Winter}'),
	('015a9ab4-f2dd-4d8a-8f63-76b3f9117711', '2025-12-30 21:47:09.451945+00', 'The Silver Stripe', 'Candy cane, grown up. Cool peppermint, dark cocoa, and a polished finish—festive without being frivolous.', 91, true, NULL, '1.75 oz Vodka (BRAND: Belvedere, SUB: Grey Goose)
0.50 oz White Chocolate Liqueur
0.25 oz Peppermint Liqueur (SUB: Peppermint Schnapps)
