Shake briefly over ice—this should be cold and silky, not frothy. Fine strain.

SERVE: Chilled coupe, up
GARNISH OPTIONS: candy canes or grated dark chocolate', '{Vodka,New,Winter}'),
	('b3d7e95d-c302-43ec-af3f-5165c150350f', '2025-12-30 21:49:17.669986+00', 'Winter Whiskey Sour', 'A sentimental favorite—bright orchard fruit, gentle spice, and perfect balance. Celebratory, but grounded.', 92, true, NULL, '1.50 oz Apple Brandy
