', '{Vodka,Winter}'),
	('1ed6af86-1c1f-4ba7-8905-a88836c9e99c', '2025-12-31 22:48:38.317568+00', 'Grandma Got Hungover By a Reindeer', 'Comforting, indulgent, and just a little unhinged—exactly how Grandma would want it. Originally served as the Harry and Izzy''s Holiday Pop-Up.', 1201, false, NULL, '4 oz HOT CHOCOLATE (SUB: rich cocoa mix or house-made dark chocolate)
1.5 oz IRISH CREAM LIQUEUR (BRAND: Baileys Salted Caramel, SUB: Baileys Original + pinch of sea salt + caramel syrup)

Stir the Irish cream into hot chocolate until fully integrated.

SERVE: Irish coffee mug or heavy glass mug, no ice
GARNISH: Whipped cream, cocoa powder, light drizzle of caramel sauce, flaky sea salt pinch', '{New,Special,Copycats}'),
	('b9ccfa91-897b-44ff-b5d1-949143c026f2', '2026-06-17 18:58:41.662592+00', 'The Golden Hour, Tomorrow', 'Ripe white peach and apricot liqueur up front, with a dark cherry backbone from the Luxardo and enough rye bourbon to keep it honest. Bright, rich, and unmistakably summer. A new refined take on Drink #31. ', 94, true, NULL, '2 oz Rye bourbon
1 oz Fresh white peach purée (SUB: Peach nectar, reduced)
0.5 oz Maraschino Liqueur 
0.5 oz Apricot liqueur
0.75 oz Fresh lemon juice
0.75 oz Simple syrup
1 dash Angostura bitters

Combine all ingredients in a shaker with ice. Shake hard for 12–15 seconds. Double-strain through a fine mesh into a chilled coupe or rocks glass. If serving on the rocks, use one large format cube.

SERVE: Coupe (up) or rocks glass over one large cube
GARNISH: Dehydrated peach wheel, brandied cherry on a pick
FLAVOR BLAST (opt.): Apricot aroma — expressed apricot peel over the glass', '{Summer,New,Bourbon}'),
	('03b87197-3e6d-4226-931d-0ff38bd6e19d', '2026-08-10 20:30:54.507266+00', 'The Ellie Clark', 'Bright citrus up front, then a slow, rising heat that lingers just long enough to make you reach for the next sip instead of your water glass. Clean, balanced, and built for anyone who wants their margarita with a little bite of history.', 621, true, NULL, '2 oz Blanco Tequila
0.75 oz fresh lime juice
0.5 oz Cointreau (SUB: triple sec)
0.5 oz Liquid Alchemist Spicy Syrup (SUB: agave nectar + 2 dashes hot sauce)
Pinch of salt

Combine all ingredients with ice, shake hard, double strain.

SERVE: Rocks glass
GARNISH: Fresh Jalepeño, tajin rim, lime wheel', '{Tequila,Special}'),
	('e96e2581-0259-416a-8791-107112733b9a', '2026-08-10 21:06:39.339199+00', 'The Ashley Phipps', '', 352, true, NULL, '2 oz VODKA 
0.75 oz ST-GERMAIN ELDERFLOWER LIQUEUR 
0.75 oz FRESH LEMON JUICE
0.5 oz SIMPLE SYRUP (SUB: honey syrup)
2 dashes ORANGE BITTERS

