SERVE: coupe, no ice
GARNISH: lemon twist, edible flower', '{Vodka,Special}'),
	('a1044ae0-ab60-4ff8-a9bd-2b83ed98f4ea', '2026-08-16 02:08:30.267288+00', 'Evelyn, Again', 'The classic Aperol Spritz. This one captures aperitivo hour in a glass: burnt-orange, effervescent, and just bitter enough to feel grown-up. It''s the taste of a sunset terrace in Veneto, no matter what''s outside your window. Named for Evelyn Morris, who ordered this drink off menu four different times.', 922, true, NULL, '2 oz APEROL (BRAND: Aperol)
3 oz PROSECCO
1 oz SODA WATER (SUB: club soda, Sprite)

Build directly in the glass over ice: Aperol first, then Prosecco, then top with soda water. Give it one gentle stir to combine.

SERVE: Large wine glass (balloon shape), over ice
GARNISH: Orange half-wheel, dropped in', NULL);


